{"answer": [{"text": "The UX Researcher (Ian Miller, eid_c3f3eff2) suggested emphasizing user testing in the 'User Experience' section of the Product Requirements Document, not the System Design Document.", "cite": [{"id": "msg:ContentForce/20260313-3-881bd", "quote": "From a UX perspective, the 'User Experience' section is solid, but I think we should emphasize user testing."}]}, {"text": "The UX Researcher suggested adding a line about iterative testing with sales teams to highlight focus on usability.", "cite": [{"id": "msg:ContentForce/20260313-3-881bd", "quote": "Adding a line about iterative testing with sales teams could highlight our focus on usability"}]}, {"text": "The System Design Document's recorded feedback does not attribute any changes to a UX Researcher; the feedback items are listed without reviewer roles.", "cite": [{"id": "doc:ContentForce/final_contentforce_system_design_document", "quote": "Add a note in the System Architecture section explaining the choice of Python and TensorFlow over other technologies like PyTorch or Java."}]}], "abstain": false}
